{"4434770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We’re In Trouble", "steam_appid": 4434770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late at night. An empty office. And one very serious problem that cannot be left here until morning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cooperative game about a situation you’d rather never find yourself in… but you already are. Together with your friends, you must quietly and discreetly carry a body out of the building without attracting attention. Any noise, awkward movement, or mistake can ruin everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong><br>Success depends on strong teamwork. Constant coordination, quick decision-making, and clear communication between players are the keys to getting out safely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ <strong>Realistic Body Physics</strong><br>The body behaves unpredictably — swinging, bumping into furniture, and getting caught on corners. You’ll need to carry it carefully, or risk drawing unwanted attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎥 <strong>Stealth and Threats</strong><br>Guards, cameras, and random NPCs may appear at the worst possible moment. The smallest mistake or unnecessary noise can sabotage the entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Challenges and Random Events</strong><br>Each level introduces new obstacles and unexpected situations. You’ll need to adapt on the fly and make fast decisions as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 <strong>Environmental Interaction</strong><br>Doors, narrow corridors, furniture, and various objects increase tension and realism. Use the space wisely and plan every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😅 <strong>Tension with a Touch of Absurdity</strong><br>A mix of intense moments and comical situations. Every awkward move can spiral into chaos, turning the operation into a thrilling and unpredictable experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late at night. An empty office. And one very serious problem that cannot be left here until morning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/cc12ed41d3724efb9be76cf6d66b681b.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cooperative game about a situation you’d rather never find yourself in… but you already are. Together with your friends, you must quietly and discreetly carry a body out of the building without attracting attention. Any noise, awkward movement, or mistake can ruin everything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/eec3bdebdb49f0116d30b77f28ffb138.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong><br>Success depends on strong teamwork. Constant coordination, quick decision-making, and clear communication between players are the keys to getting out safely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.poster.avif?t=1781879997\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.webm?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434770/extras/9329bc62dd17a8cd7324b3892218c07f.mp4?t=1781879997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ <strong>Realistic Body Physics</strong><br>The body behaves unpredictably — swinging, bumping into furniture, and getting caught on corners. You’ll need to carry it carefully, or risk drawing unwanted attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎥 <strong>Stealth and Threats</strong><br>Guards, cameras, and random NPCs may appear at the worst possible moment. The smallest mistake or unnecessary noise can sabotage the entire operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Challenges and Random Events</strong><br>Each level introduces new obstacles and unexpected situations. You’ll need to adapt on the fly and make fast decisions as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 <strong>Environmental Interaction</strong><br>Doors, narrow corridors, furniture, and various objects increase tension and realism. Use the space wisely and plan every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😅 <strong>Tension with a Touch of Absurdity</strong><br>A mix of intense moments and comical situations. Every awkward move can spiral into chaos, turning the operation into a thrilling and unpredictable experience.</p>", "short_description": "A CO-OP stealth game about a problem that can’t wait until morning. 🕵️‍♂️ An empty office, a body, and absolute silence. Work together, avoid guards and cameras, handle unpredictable physics, and escape unnoticed. One mistake can ruin everything.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com